; Behaviour block: a seed-spitting plant (kind 12, room 14)
;
; Used by the three magenta plants of Hidden garden that spit seeds (attribute $43). After the 5 header bytes:
; attribute, sprite height, width in bytes, then the addresses of its two sprites.
@label=BehaviourSeedPlant
b$953D DEFB $03,$01,$07,$06,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $9542 DEFB $43,$08,$02  ; attribute, sprite height, width (bytes)
 $9545 DEFW $EF4B    ; sprite, frame 0
 $9547 DEFW $EF4D    ; sprite, frame 1
